visit our friends at Google,
that's the growth of iPhones, right?

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.989
Look at the growth of Androids
in the same quarters.

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:36.800
So there's something really
extraordinary going on that's creating

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.770
enormous opportunities in and
around mobility.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.940
But mobility's not the only story.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.510
Another powerful one is social networks.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:50.540
Eight years ago there was no Facebook,
today Facebook has 1.2 billion users,

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.860
a half billion of them use it every day.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:56.745
And what that's allowed entrepreneurs
to do, is to re-imagine and

00:14:56.745 --> 00:14:58.270
re-invent the web.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:14:59.410
Every application,

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:05.440
every service is now being recreated
in the form mobile and social.

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:08.040
So we're moving from the old
web of documents and

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.709
websites to the new web
based on people and places.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:15.700
&gt;From documents and websites, to people and

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:19.620
places, and
it's having a quite extraordinary effect.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:24.290
If you look at the companies just in the
last few years that are re-imagining and

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.150
reinventing the web.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.830
Back then, newspaper,
was the way we got our information.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.060
Today it's Twitter with
real-time reporting, graphics.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:35.120
Back then, we used magazines.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.640
Today, these are social magazines and

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:42.540
moving very rapidly to be a rich way to
get to the most valuable stuff on the web.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.990
I'm citing Flipboard, look at Path,
back then it was diaries.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:50.960
Today it's really intimate sharing of
frequent moments in a truly personal

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:55.800
truly social network not just
a gathering of your acquaintances.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:59.990
Next one, for Sarah somebody asked about
re-envisioning higher education and

