Digital health is
a frontier that the nation,

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:36.700
our country desperately needs which
is to use big data, use mobility, and

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:41.169
use smarts, and change the incentives to
deal with the crisis in healthcare cost.

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.570
We're investors in a half dozen,
or so of these companies,

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.340
and very excited about what that can mean.

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.590
Healthcare system, the single largest,

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.180
most screwed up part of
the American economy.

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:57.180
There are important
innovations underway in energy.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:00.010
The most efficient machine in the world
that can burn a natural gas into

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.520
