it is Bloomenergy and

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:06.480
Bloom he sold almost $400
million of those last year.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.275
They have a bigger backlog than that for
the coming year.

00:17:09.275 --> 00:17:12.720
But I want to tell you about these though
is they take a lot of capital, and

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:13.821
they take a long time.

00:17:13.821 --> 00:17:17.970
They have entrenched incumbents,
but the markets are enormous.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.260
And really ripe for innovation.

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:21.820
Here's energy innovation.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:25.019
How many people have seen, or
installed a smart thermostat from Nest?

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:29.240
We're blown away by
the results of this company.

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:33.030
In just a year's time, there are more
than five times the revenue forecast.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:37.165
And who would've thought you could
take an ugly old thermostat,

00:17:37.165 --> 00:17:40.938
re-imagine, reinvent it,
and then sell it at $300?

00:17:40.938 --> 00:17:43.320
Quite extraordinary and disruptive.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.990
There's another part of
energy that really matters.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:47.820
About 15% of the world's energy
is used in data centers, and

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:51.880
what limits the performance of those
mobile devices is the energy they consume.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:55.650
So, we have a low power initiative that
involves five breakthrough technologies.

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:59.070
It would do everything from taking
us past Moore's Law to delivering

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:01.790
displays that are ten
times more efficient.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:04.660
Very exciting work in that
low power initiative.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:08.240
And there's another example of innovation.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.480
We're backing some entrepreneurs
that have found a way, and

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:17.090
you can buy it at Whole Foods now in
small quantities to deliver chicken

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:19.850
that has none of the entrails,
none of the diseases,

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:24.299
none of the blood, it completely tastes
